clueweb09-en0002-45-18075.0 Movie News Ron Howard promises new thrills PA Entertainment [Ron Howard says Angels And Demons will be set in the Vatican] Ron Howard says Angels And Demons will be set in the Vatican Ron Howard has promised Angels & Demons will be very different from The Da Vinci Code. The director insists that while his second movie adaptation of a Dan Brown novel stars the character of Robert Langdon - played by Tom Hanks - it is very exciting and new. Ron said: "I had a really fun exciting time working on that movie, it exercised a lot of different muscles for me because it is very contemporary, really a ticking bomb kind of a story and just the rhythms and the feel of it and the look of it all kind of brand new territory for me and I enjoyed it. "It's a continuation of the Robert Langdon character
