clueweb09-enwp00-42-11306.0 Clint Howard From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Jump to: navigation, search Clint Howard Born Clinton E. Howard April 20, 1959 (1959-04-20) (age 49) Burbank, California, USA Occupation actor Spouse(s) 1st Wife (1986ýýý1987;divorced) Melanie Howard (1995ýýýpresent) Official website Clint Howard (born April 20, 1959) is an American film and television actor. He is a seasoned character actor with numerous brief appearances on television and movies, usually noted for his awkward and homely appearance. He has played many bit parts in movies directed by his brother, actor-turned-director Ron Howard. He is also the uncle of actress Bryce Dallas Howard. Contents 1 Biography 1.1 Early life 1.2 Television 1.3 Film 1.4 Music 1.5 Recognition 1.6 Personal life 2 References 3 External links [edit] Biography [edit] Early life Howard was born Clinton E. Howard in Burbank, California; the son of actors Rance Howard and Jean Speegle Howard, and the younger brother of actor-turned-director Ron
