clueweb09-en0006-40-07309.0 Quit Smoking Welcome Guest | Login or Register Home Is Self-Hypnosis Beneficial To Quit Smoking? For reasons of health and economics, and because it is becoming more and more a social taboo, you’ve made the decision. You will quit smoking. That decision is one of the hardest decisions you’ll ever be glad you made. All and all, the decision is the easy part. It is the execution of actions necessary to achieve the result that is difficult. So you have to be prepared. One way to get prepared and stay prepared is the use of self-hypnosis to quit smoking. What is Self-Hypnosis? Hypnosis brings on a trance-like state. It is not a deep sleep. You naturally go into trances all the time—sometimes while watching TV or listening to the radio, sometimes when you are driving. You know you’ve acted from a trance state when you automatically do something without being
